WEBVTT

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:03.480
<b>Sket-dan!</b>

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:09.400
<b>Sket-dan
Now accepting requests</b>

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:06.950
And there you have it.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.720
Oh? So you're already on the bench?

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.580
Shucks...

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:11.850
Good for you!

00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:13.270
Here, have a li'l candy!

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.510
Oh, thanks.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:17.000
I'm just a sub, though.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.330
It's all thanks to you guys...

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:22.070
Teacher! Sugihara-kun's barfed!

00:00:22.070 --> 00:00:23.480
What's with this candy?

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:28.710
Judging from the wrapper, it is a liver 
skewer-flavored Pelollipop candy.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:34.090
A-Anyway, as thanks, I'll make sure to tell 
everyone else on the team about you guys.

00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:34.810
Later!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.390
Good for him, you know?

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.660
He's obviously really into 
the basketball team....

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:41.800
Yeah!

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.050
What's it now?

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:47.580
You forget somethin', Teppei?

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.080
Hey!

00:00:50.130 --> 00:00:51.150
Huh? He's not here.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.750
No, not <i>there</i>!

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:54.070
There! Down there!

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.190
Down?

00:00:56.390 --> 00:00:57.400
Who?!

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:57.910
I am sorry!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:00:59.030
I asked who you were!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:32.340
I art known as Takemitsu Shinzou!

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:34.000
<b>Episode 2: Peppermint Samurai</b>

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.710
I hath come to place a 
request for the Sket-dan!

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:37.180
A request?

00:02:37.180 --> 00:02:40.070
I do apologize for the sudden query...

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:41.070
Uh...

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:45.090
It's like some samurai has been transported 
to modern times, or something...

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:47.870
Dude, what's with the one-shot manga setup?

00:02:47.870 --> 00:02:50.290
Class 2-A, Takemitsu Shinzou.

00:02:50.290 --> 00:02:52.000
Captain of the Kendo Team.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.210
His unique way of speaking is the effect 
of his father's period drama acting career.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:58.880
How do you possess such knowledge?!

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.820
Art you a spy for the enemy?!

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.360
Hold it, hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.150
Please don't slash our Switch!

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.220
And wait, why are you 
carrying around a katana?!

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.280
You'll be arrested for violating 
the gun and sword control law!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.290
You needn't worry!

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:11.150
This is a...

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:13.000
..."repurika"!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.640
How the hell should we know?!

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:16.080
And who is the "enemy", anyway?!

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:18.960
We ain't at war! We're in modern society!

00:03:18.960 --> 00:03:20.890
I-I truly apologize.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:24.500
For though it is my dream 
to become a true samurai,

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.880
I oft cause concern in others 
due to my odd behavior!

00:03:28.230 --> 00:03:29.470
If it hath come to this...

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:32.590
Hold it, hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.340
Don't commit seppuku in 
someone else's clubroom!

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:37.070
Don't you realize who it is that's gonna 
hafta clean your guts off the floor?!

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:39.740
You needn't worry!

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:40.740
This is also a...

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:41.740
..."repurika"!

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:44.650
Whatever, just tell us your request already!

00:03:44.650 --> 00:03:46.830
You see, in my team...

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:50.080
I, a second year, hath taken 
on the role of Captain.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:53.470
The samurai dude ain't showin' up!

00:03:53.470 --> 00:03:56.700
Makin' us wait, is he? 
Where the hell is the guy?

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:58.960
But it is a fact that I...

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.000
I art holding everyone back in tournaments!

00:04:02.440 --> 00:04:04.300
What do you mean?

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.020
I mean not self-flattery,

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:10.570
but I am proud that in my first 
year I participated in tournaments

00:04:06.020 --> 00:04:14.240
<b>[Note: Senpou is the participant in the senpou round (first round) of a kendo tournament]</b>

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.880
as the senpou, and was undefeated!

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.240
But...!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:17.860
Now that I have taken the taisho 
position, I can no longer win at all!

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:21.820
<b>[Note: Taisho is the participant in the taisho round (final round) of a kendo tournament]</b>

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.890
I attempted seppuku once or twice...

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:22.150
You needn't worry!

00:04:22.150 --> 00:04:23.340
It was with a "repurika".

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.700
It is true that his record after 
becoming the taisho is quite poor.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.770
But I train twice as much as anyone!

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:33.190
Nay, three times as much!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.950
It is not merely pride!

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:38.320
But for what reason I know not, in the 
tournaments I can never get results...

00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:42.390
Soon there shall be a regional 
tournament, but I art at my wits' end!

00:04:42.390 --> 00:04:45.840
I have tried to throw myself into 
the river twice or thrice...

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.470
Don't go throwin' away your life like that.

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:50.360
You can't go givin' up.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:53.430
And so I have come to you 
three gentlefolk for help!

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.270
Right! So to make it short...

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.510
We need to help you...

00:04:56.510 --> 00:04:58.560
...so that you can show your true strength...

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:00.900
...during the tournament!

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:03.640
We accept!

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:07.180
We'll rebuild your mental 
state from the ground up!

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:08.050
Be it truth?!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.280
I am grateful!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:14.500
Then, I would be much obliged if you would 
exchange contact information with I?

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.750
Don't tell me he's gonna 
whip out ink & paper, right?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.200
He's a samurai. I could see it.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.260
I will send you my "adoresu" 
by infrared transmission.

00:05:23.260 --> 00:05:24.170
Wait a moment.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.530
Whoa there!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:27.140
Way to get all modern, buddy!

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.590
That ain't like a samurai at all, dang it!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:31.100
Men!

00:05:29.590 --> 00:05:35.310
<b>[Note: Kendo terminology for a strike to the face mask]</b>

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:35.590
Thank you for waiting.

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.090
I stopped by the convenience store.

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:38.100
Convenience...?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.490
Man, he's not a samurai at all...

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.870
Whatever.

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:46.970
So, can you act out how a match 
goes in a tournament for us?

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:48.240
Yes, understood.

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:50.050
First, I concentrate my mind and soul.

00:05:50.050 --> 00:05:51.810
Now you're gettin' into it!

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.250
I wrap my head in a towel.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.940
No wasted movements, like a pro!

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:55.970
I place on my bogu.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:58.250
<b>[Note: Bogu is the term for kendo protective gear]</b>

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:58.250
You do look like a real samurai...

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.160
Then, one Friske!

00:06:00.160 --> 00:06:02.300
Hey, hold it, hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.120
What the hell's with the Friske?

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:09.110
Well, it's become a custom for I to eat a 
little something after putting on my bogu.

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:10.880
So that's why he went to 
the convenience store...

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.670
That's not like a samurai at all.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.820
It's just lame... Friske? Seriously?

00:06:15.820 --> 00:06:17.670
What say you?!

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.140
My father hath taught me...

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.740
The stimulating effect of a Friske 
raises your ability in battle!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:24.540
Its refreshing effect maintains 
your concentration!

00:06:24.540 --> 00:06:27.530
In other words, it is standard issue 
for men who aim for the sword!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.990
Even Miyamoto Musashi, before he duels...

00:06:31.050 --> 00:06:33.880
Even Yagyu Jubei, before he fights...

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:37.330
Even Mito Koumon, before 
he metes out punishment...

00:06:37.590 --> 00:06:39.390
Friske didn't exist then!

00:06:39.390 --> 00:06:40.960
Your dad's been lyin' to you, buddy!

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.350
What say you?!

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:44.440
Whatever, just do it already!

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:45.830
As you wish!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:49.780
All right!

00:06:49.780 --> 00:06:50.300
Come at me!

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:54.580
Men!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.100
Ippon! Match over!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:07:02.020
<b>[Note: Ippon = One full point given for a successful strike in a kendo match]</b>

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:00.940
Okay, so we've established that 
you're strong in practice.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:02.020
So, what's the problem...?

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.560
I cannot show my strength in tournaments...

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:08.650
Then it's gotta be a mental issue, you know?

00:07:08.650 --> 00:07:11.540
We gots to give you the guts 
to get over the pressure!

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:14.240
When it comes to guts, leave it to me!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:19.970
If you want to cleanse the mind, no 
better place than under a waterfall!

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:22.370
Awesome! This might work!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.750
<b>Ishibotokei High School vs. Kaimei Academy</b>

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.430
Men!

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:28.830
He caught a cold, damn it!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.340
This will not do.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.870
A strong mind resides in a strong body.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:35.510
Therefore!

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:39.720
The inimitable training cast!

00:07:39.720 --> 00:07:41.490
Baka-bands!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.020
This'll totally work! Probably!

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.440
<b>Natsu High School vs. Kaimei Academy</b>

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:47.110
Men!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.410
He can't even move!

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.350
I have failed!

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.790
I forgot to account for muscle fatigue...

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.260
Sheesh, you people are useless.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:08:01.250
If he needs help concentrating, 
you should leave that to me!

00:08:02.330 --> 00:08:03.330
Disqualified!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:07.400
You're the only one who can concentrate 
better with those things!

00:08:07.400 --> 00:08:10.750
Don't blame me! He wore 
them outside his face mask!

00:08:11.260 --> 00:08:13.340
You hath done enough...

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.680
I art truly thankful, yes...

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:18.300
But we haven't...

00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:18.920
No!

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:23.570
The taisho should do his 
best, with his own power!

00:08:23.570 --> 00:08:27.610
I must apologize for allowing my weakness 
to control me and relying on others!

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.410
Please, cometh in support to the tournament!

00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:35.460
What'll we do?

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.030
Don't ask me...

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.320
<b>65th Regional High School Kendo Tournament</b>

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:41.380
Prepared? I shall win today, indeed!

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:44.900
I shall win, and prove to 
everyone my position as taisho!

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:46.680
Everyone, take heart!

00:08:50.430 --> 00:08:52.260
I'm gonna win!

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:55.000
Isn't that...

00:08:53.650 --> 00:08:55.630
I'm gonna win!

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:56.340
He's trying to psych himself up.

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.050
Figures... Tied 2-2, so it's up 
to the final, taisho round...

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:07.680
And we still don't know why he can't win.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:08.770
This is all screwed...

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:10.330
It'll be fine!

00:09:10.330 --> 00:09:13.380
Look at how fired up he is!

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:16.530
He's gonna do it this time, for sure!

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.370
You can win!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.000
You'll win it all, no ifs ands or buts!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:26.520
Huh?

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.330
What?

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.000
Don't you think he's looking a bit... off?

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:31.530
For reals!

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:34.190
He's making a face like an idiot!

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:35.340
I suspect...

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:39.640
The taisho round is the final one, 
so he can't keep it up long enough.

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:42.310
We got a case of short attention span here?!

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:43.150
What is he, 12?!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:45.140
Wait, he said it before...

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.850
The stimulating effect of a Friske 
raises your ability in battle!

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:50.490
Its refreshing effect maintains 
your concentration!

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:51.630
Also...

00:09:51.630 --> 00:09:55.660
In my first year I participated in 
tournaments as the senpou, and was undefeated!

00:09:55.660 --> 00:10:00.150
Now that I have taken the taisho 
position, I can no longer win at all!

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:01.050
I see!

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.300
It's not about psyching himself up!

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:04.690
The Friske really worked!

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:07.560
It only works for a short time!

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:09.620
He never realized that!

00:10:10.150 --> 00:10:13.680
He needs to wait until the taisho 
round before eating the Friske!

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:15.380
Taishos, forward!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:19.100
Crap, what'll we do?

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:20.530
What can we do?

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:23.220
Actually, I have some Friske on me.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:23.750
Switch!

00:10:23.750 --> 00:10:24.310
Begin!

00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.980
He's all bent over!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:28.200
Men!

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.290
Switch, hand one to me!

00:10:31.290 --> 00:10:32.270
What're you gonna do?

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:38.070
I'll shoot this right into his mouth!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:42.850
I will explain!

00:10:42.850 --> 00:10:44.490
When Bossun puts on his goggles,

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.000
he can concentrate with his entire mind

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.860
on the aim of his super-powerful 
pachinko ball slingshot!

00:10:49.860 --> 00:10:52.530
Stop blabbing on like you're all cool!

00:10:52.530 --> 00:10:53.420
I can see it!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:56.150
Here I go!

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:59.730
Friske Special Slingshot!

00:11:03.590 --> 00:11:05.100
Men!

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:11.810
Did it work?

00:11:15.510 --> 00:11:16.610
All right!

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:19.990
Men!

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:22.640
Men!

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.820
Do!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.780
<b>[Note: Do is a kendo strike to the hip.]</b>

00:11:27.400 --> 00:11:29.730
Ippon! It's over!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:32.640
Captain!

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.430
Captain!

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.430
Bow!

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:43.600
You did so good!

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:45.310
I'm proud!

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:50.350
Captain!

00:11:50.350 --> 00:11:50.890
Captain!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.630
Are you okay?

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:53.890
<b>*blah*</b>

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.310
Uh...

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.970
For your information, my Friske 
are "super hard mint" flavored.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:03.790
So it's got a strong high 
but a serious down?!

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:07.380
Wait, then... Isn't this doping?

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:10.650
<b>Then, later</b>

00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:13.730
Well, we didn't exactly solve his request...

00:12:13.730 --> 00:12:15.980
But at least he won the 
match, so it's all good.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:16.800
Yes.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:17.780
Yup!

00:12:20.710 --> 00:12:22.090
Yabasu, yabasu!

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:22.920
Yabasu!

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:24.970
<b>Episode 2.5
Ape Escape</b>

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.980
Sket Dance!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:34.980
Sket Dance!

00:12:35.420 --> 00:12:37.270
So, you see...

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:40.000
My parents have gone on a vacation.

00:12:40.000 --> 00:12:42.000
I thought, "Uh-oh!"

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.000
Yabasu!

00:12:41.230 --> 00:12:44.280
<b>[Note: "Yabasu" is a slang form of "yabai" = "uh, oh!" as well as Yabasawa's nickname/vocal quirk]</b>

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:44.900
I took him to school in secret, but...

00:12:44.900 --> 00:12:48.250
I can't look after him during practice, so...

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:51.240
Could you look after Yeti for me?

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:54.010
Uh, Yabasawa-san, look here 
a sec. We're not really a...

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.460
Anyway, good luck.

00:12:55.460 --> 00:12:57.930
W-Wait up! This ain't 
right! Don't wish us luck!

00:12:57.930 --> 00:13:00.640
Why do we have to take care 
of your white-handed gibbon?

00:12:58.590 --> 00:13:00.640
Sure, we'll take him.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.270
I totally <i>love</i> animals!

00:13:03.270 --> 00:13:06.610
That's why they call me 
"Lady Hime, nature lover"!

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:07.570
They do not!

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:09.030
Now, come here, it's okay.

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:10.730
No need to be afraid.

00:13:13.700 --> 00:13:15.350
How cute...

00:13:14.780 --> 00:13:15.240
<b>Squeeze</b>

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:19.030
U-Uh... "Lady Hime"?

00:13:19.270 --> 00:13:19.980
L-Lady...

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.900
Why'd you hit him?!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.100
The client's standing right there!

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.480
As if I care!

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.850
It's that damn Sket-dan again!

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:31.290
Those good-for-nothing loudmouths!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:32.590
Kanegi-sensei...

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.650
Kanegi-sensei...

00:13:33.650 --> 00:13:34.830
Kanegi-sensei...

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:36.590
Be quiet!

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:38.840
You think this is a zoo?!

00:13:38.840 --> 00:13:40.850
Yabasu! Yabasu, yabasu!

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:42.520
Good luck with him!

00:13:42.980 --> 00:13:43.780
Yabasu.

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:44.710
Yabasu, yabasu.

00:13:44.710 --> 00:13:47.010
What the heck are you doing, people?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.360
Please, no need to be that angry.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.970
It is our club activity, after all...

00:13:51.970 --> 00:13:53.640
What is this "Sket-dan" anyway?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.270
It's just a collection of people who don't 
have anywhere else to go, is what it is!

00:13:57.550 --> 00:13:59.150
Teamwork!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.970
The most important thing in society 
is the ability to work together!

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:03.300
Altogether now!

00:14:03.300 --> 00:14:04.630
Teamwork!

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:07.700
Yes! That is what you lack!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.830
Now you kids quit monkeying around and 
get this animal off school grounds!

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:11.730
Hey hey.

00:14:11.730 --> 00:14:12.740
Hi hi.

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:14.120
Oh, that's right...

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:18.070
You're the faculty adviser for the 
softball team, if I remember right.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.130
And what about it?

00:14:19.130 --> 00:14:24.110
The club members say the way you 
throw, they nearly die laughing.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:25.300
Yeah, totally!

00:14:25.300 --> 00:14:27.050
They say you throw like a girl!

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.420
Shut up!

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.070
You screw with me any more 
and I'll shut down your club!

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:34.810
Your faculty adviser is the chemistry 
teacher, Chuma-sensei, right?

00:14:34.810 --> 00:14:35.900
Where?!

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.220
Why isn't he here?

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:41.680
Well, Chu-san's our adviser 
in name only, basically.

00:14:41.680 --> 00:14:43.710
He hardly ever shows up.

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:47.030
He's probably cooped up in the lab 
experimenting with some dubious chemicals...

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.840
Ooh, scary...

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:53.270
Whoops, I did it again.

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.350
But why does it explode when I do this?

00:14:56.350 --> 00:14:59.580
Even if I did it right, these 
chemicals are all crap.

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.360
Now then...

00:15:03.670 --> 00:15:05.210
This is a problem.

00:15:05.210 --> 00:15:10.450
So you see, I sealed up the explosive 
chemicals in this capsule.

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.840
And... Yeah, right...

00:15:12.840 --> 00:15:14.480
You know, over there.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.250
Behind the school building.

00:15:16.250 --> 00:15:18.960
There's a little open area, right?

00:15:18.960 --> 00:15:21.270
You guys go blow this up there.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.010
Oh, hell no!

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:24.550
What?

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:26.990
You're taking care of a monkey, right?

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:28.190
So deal with my bomb.

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:31.580
It ain't right for a teacher to make 
their students do bomb disposal!

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:32.760
Do it your own damn self!

00:15:32.760 --> 00:15:34.800
Man, what a pain.

00:15:34.800 --> 00:15:37.080
I am in trouble. Please save me.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.910
You can blow your own damn fool head off!

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.180
Hey now, you sure you should act so cold?

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.980
Maybe I'll just quit...

00:15:44.980 --> 00:15:46.990
...being the Sket-dan's faculty adviser.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.120
There it is!

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.330
This guy is such a...

00:15:49.330 --> 00:15:51.010
He's pure evil!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:57.660
Hey, careful there. That 
thing'll blow up pretty easy.

00:15:57.660 --> 00:15:59.210
The school building'll be gone in a flash...

00:15:59.210 --> 00:16:00.420
What? Why?!

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:04.900
"Oops, I'm all out of shampoo!" is 
not the right level of concern here!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.190
I'm just kidding.

00:16:07.190 --> 00:16:08.570
It's not that powerful.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.570
Worst case scenario, this room would go...

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:13.630
C-Crap!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.560
Give that back now!

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:16.900
Come 'ere, li'l doggie!

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.810
Be good and put down the bomb, 'kay?

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:21.160
Lay it there...

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.250
Open up your favorite backpack...

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:24.370
Put the bomb...

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.800
...inside...

00:16:25.800 --> 00:16:26.880
...wait!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.090
Don't do that!

00:16:31.960 --> 00:16:33.180
Where'd he go?

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.370
We gotta find him! He's got the bomb!

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.400
Okay, we'll split up and search!

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:40.560
We've gotta find him before Yabasawa-san's 
club's practice is over!

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:44.070
You mean before he blows himself up, right?

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:45.520
You shut the hell up!

00:16:45.520 --> 00:16:47.450
Switch, bring up a map of the academy!

00:16:47.450 --> 00:16:51.060
That reminds me, you haven't spoken a 
word during this second story at all!

00:16:51.060 --> 00:16:53.280
It's time for the "Switch, 
you're awesome!" segment!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:55.190
What are you talking about?

00:16:55.190 --> 00:16:56.400
What's that?

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.110
A homing device.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:17:01.900
Just in case he tried to escape, I placed 
this miniature homing device on him.

00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:04.570
We can see the monkey's location on this map.

00:17:06.170 --> 00:17:07.790
Switch, you're awesome!

00:17:07.790 --> 00:17:09.460
Hold it, hold it, hold it!

00:17:09.970 --> 00:17:12.300
Shinzou, catch him!

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:16.050
No looksies!

00:17:18.410 --> 00:17:19.260
Where's the monkey?

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.510
He entered the club room 
right in front of you!

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:23.600
Right, okay!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:26.110
Leave this to me!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.160
No looksies!

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:34.060
You suck!

00:17:34.060 --> 00:17:34.870
It's the Whatever-dan!

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.190
Get banned already!

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:38.840
That was the girls' changing 
room, you bastard!

00:17:38.840 --> 00:17:42.100
All I am doing is telling 
you the monkey's route.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:43.870
If you have a problem with 
that, tell it to Yeti.

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:46.250
He's now in the room next 
door to the boys' bathroom.

00:17:46.250 --> 00:17:49.050
Hold it! That's the girls' bathroom, right?

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:51.890
Bossun, I'll bust into the bathroom!

00:17:51.890 --> 00:17:54.070
Okay, then I'll circle around back!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.670
Hime, chase him out the window!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:56.630
Roger!

00:17:56.630 --> 00:17:58.240
Ready, set...

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:02.300
Oh, Bossun...

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:04.180
What the heck is with that 
tight-fitting outfit?

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:04.950
Don't tell me...

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:06.790
Whoa, like, super whoa!

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:09.490
This is the cheerleading 
club's practice area.

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:10.350
Uh, right...

00:18:10.350 --> 00:18:12.080
Bossun, why're you here?

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:13.470
Please move...

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:13.740
Did you come to watch me?

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.410
Isn't that like, whoa?

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:18.740
Damn it... I can't exactly tell her 
that her pet's about to blow up!

00:18:16.350 --> 00:18:19.240
By the way, where's Yeti?

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.710
There he goes!

00:18:23.100 --> 00:18:23.840
What?

00:18:23.840 --> 00:18:24.940
What, nothing!

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:29.050
Yeti? Well, he's so happy, he 
might spontaneously combust!

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.540
Ooh, he's so cute!

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.710
Where did you come from?

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.880
Ah, you have a backpack!

00:18:37.770 --> 00:18:39.500
You'll give it to me?

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.610
I wonder what it is?

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:41.750
Don't!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.000
What?

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.070
B-mb!

00:18:44.070 --> 00:18:44.820
Huh?

00:18:44.820 --> 00:18:45.960
Isn't that Himeko-chan?

00:18:45.960 --> 00:18:47.200
She's saying something...

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.250
Bo-mb!

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:50.340
What? We can't hear you!

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.010
Bom-b!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.520
Huh? What?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:56.360
B...mb! Th... a... bo...!

00:18:58.690 --> 00:19:00.570
She's making a really scary face!

00:19:03.240 --> 00:19:06.630
Come 'ere monkey! Unhand that!

00:19:06.630 --> 00:19:07.620
Crap!

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:09.850
Himeko! Can you hear me, Himeko?

00:19:09.850 --> 00:19:12.340
Your target has entered the 
flower arrangement clubroom.

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.730
Both of you, hurry to the position!

00:19:14.730 --> 00:19:16.660
I repeat! Hurry to the position!

00:19:16.660 --> 00:19:18.810
Stop orderin' me around, asshole!

00:19:18.810 --> 00:19:19.750
Himeko!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.700
Bossun!

00:19:21.700 --> 00:19:22.960
He said that the monkey went into 
the flower arrangement clubroom.

00:19:22.960 --> 00:19:23.690
Yeah...

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:27.030
That damn monkey only 
goes where there's girls.

00:19:27.380 --> 00:19:28.380
Girls?

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:32.600
What is it?

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.790
That's it! Girls!

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.880
We'll set a decoy!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.300
Huh? A decoy? Who?

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:41.200
Switch, I need you to prepare something.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:42.150
Answer me!

00:19:42.150 --> 00:19:43.910
Who is gonna be the...

00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:48.870
Yeah, I figured it was gonna go this way.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:49.890
Whatever.

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:51.050
Come 'ere, you pervy monkey!

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.170
He's mine.

00:19:56.170 --> 00:19:59.250
Yeah, he's a monkey all right... 
His noggin' ain't so hot.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.160
Noticed, huh?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.430
Fine then. I didn't think I'd 
catch you with this, anyway!

00:20:06.110 --> 00:20:09.560
We'll never be able to 
keep up with your speed!

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:13.230
But if we go vertical...

00:20:18.100 --> 00:20:19.980
Scary!

00:20:28.190 --> 00:20:29.580
No looksies!

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.080
Bossun!

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.080
Bossun!

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:46.590
Here he is.

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:48.590
Gross...

00:20:48.590 --> 00:20:50.290
Don't do it that way!

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.100
Use something more comical!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.530
No looksies!

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:58.470
Dowory... Imfin, jusfin.

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:00.430
What the heck is this?

00:21:02.120 --> 00:21:03.870
That's a softball!

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:06.860
Looks like it got switched out somewhere...

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:09.280
Then, the real bomb is...

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.980
Shit!

00:21:10.980 --> 00:21:14.660
The club members say the way you 
throw, they nearly die laughing!

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:15.810
Like a girl!

00:21:15.810 --> 00:21:16.890
Like a girl!

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:17.960
Like a girl!

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:19.700
Oh, yeah?!

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:23.210
It's not like I haven't 
been practicing every day!

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:29.760
Report:

00:21:30.320 --> 00:21:32.800
One athletic storage shed destroyed.

00:21:32.800 --> 00:21:36.480
None of the students around it were injured.

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.740
However one teacher was injured.

00:21:38.740 --> 00:21:41.050
In addition, there was one 
student who was injured.

00:21:41.050 --> 00:21:43.780
Hey, get this thing offa me already!

00:21:45.030 --> 00:21:47.410
Yes! Please, enough!

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:49.880
I feel so sorry for you!

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:53.710
It's not gonna end with me like this, is it?!

00:21:53.710 --> 00:21:55.230
Get it off of me!

00:21:55.780 --> 00:21:58.560
Yeah! Poor thing! Yeah!

00:21:58.560 --> 00:22:00.840
You don't feel sorry for me at all!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:02.780
Now, take it off!

00:23:33.550 --> 00:23:35.800
Clubroom Talk Corner!

00:23:38.790 --> 00:23:40.610
What's the matter? Why 
aren't you saying anything?

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:43.500
You! Stop pushing me, and keep shooting!

00:23:43.500 --> 00:23:49.430
In this segment, we'll tell you all kinds 
of things about the Sket-dan, just for you!

00:23:49.430 --> 00:23:50.320
Th-This time, we'll...

00:23:50.570 --> 00:23:51.680
Time's up.

00:23:51.450 --> 00:23:54.660
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:53.050 --> 00:23:54.660
Sheesh, what was with that segment?

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.160
You won't get away from us today!

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.740
We's gots <i>her</i>...

00:23:58.740 --> 00:24:00.150
...backin' us up!

00:24:00.150 --> 00:24:01.870
"We's"? Now, look here...

00:24:01.870 --> 00:24:05.250
My name is Kibitsu Momoka. 
Also known as Onihime.

00:24:05.700 --> 00:24:06.540
What?

00:24:06.540 --> 00:24:08.270
W-Where do we come in?

00:24:08.270 --> 00:24:09.590
Himeko's in trouble!

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:12.180
Next time: The Legendary Onihime!

00:24:13.750 --> 00:24:15.010
This is bad! Let's go!

00:24:15.010 --> 00:24:16.670
We're the academy support group!

00:24:16.670 --> 00:24:18.350
Sket Dance!
